public with sharing class DiscountApprovalService {

    private static final String LARGE_DISCOUNT_PERMISSION = 'Approve_Large_Discount';
    private static final Decimal MAX_REP_DISCOUNT = 15;

    @AuraEnabled
    public static Boolean canApprove(Decimal discountPercent) {
        if (discountPercent == null || discountPercent < 0) {
            return false;
        }
        if (discountPercent <= MAX_REP_DISCOUNT) {
            return true;
        }
        return FeatureManagement.checkPermission(LARGE_DISCOUNT_PERMISSION);
    }
}
```

Notes:
- `FeatureManagement.checkPermission` evaluates the custom permission directly for the running user (regardless of whether it is granted via this permission set, another permission set, or a permission set group), so it satisfies the "check the custom permission itself" requirement.
- `hasActivationRequired` is `false` on the permission set so it takes effect immediately upon assignment.
- The custom permission has no `licenseId`, so it is not tied to a license.

